{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Revpn_ccsk.Enriching</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":true,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"revpn-ccsk","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Revpn_ccsk","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Enriching","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-net_system\"><a href=\"#type-net_system\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> net_system</span><span> = </span><span>{</span></code><ol><li id=\"type-net_system.net\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-net_system.net\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>net : <a href=\"../Net/index.html#type-labelled_net\">Net.labelled_net</a>;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-net_system.m\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-net_system.m\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>m : <a href=\"../Token/index.html#type-markingTok\">Token.markingTok</a>;</span></code></li></ol><code><span>}</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>A <i>net system</i> is a pair <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">(N, m)</code> with <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">N</code> labelled net and the marking <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">m</code> is a mapping associating to each place a multiset of tokens, i.e. <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">m : S \\to \\mu\\textsf{Tok}</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-make_net_system\"><a href=\"#val-make_net_system\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> make_net_system : <span><a href=\"../Net/index.html#type-labelled_net\">Net.labelled_net</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Token/index.html#type-markingTok\">Token.markingTok</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-net_system\">net_system</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-immediate_transitions\"><a href=\"#val-immediate_transitions\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> immediate_transitions : \u000A  <span><a href=\"../Net/index.html#type-labelled_net\">Net.labelled_net</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<a href=\"../Net/index.html#type-transition\">Net.transition</a> * <a href=\"../Net/index.html#type-transition\">Net.transition</a>)</span> list</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><b>Immediate dependency.</b> Two transitions <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">t_1, t_2</code> are in <i>immediate dependency</i> if there is a place <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">a \\in P</code> such that <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">(t_1, a) \\in R \\wedge (a, t_2) \\in R</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-is_enabled_tk\"><a href=\"#val-is_enabled_tk\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> is_enabled_tk : <span><a href=\"#type-net_system\">net_system</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Net/index.html#type-transition\">Net.transition</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>is_enabled_tk tn tid</code> checks if transition <code>tid</code> is enabled in the token net <code>tn</code>.</p><p>A transition <code>tid</code> with input places <code>p1,…,pk</code> is enabled iff the current marking token has label in <code>p1,…,pk</code>, i.e., the token currently sits in one of the input places.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-next_id\"><a href=\"#val-next_id\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> next_id : <span><a href=\"../Token/Token/index.html#type-t\">Token.Token.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>next_id tk</code> returns a fresh <code>identifier = size of the token + 1</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-unopt_net_system\"><a href=\"#val-unopt_net_system\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> unopt_net_system : <span><span><a href=\"#type-net_system\">net_system</a> option</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-net_system\">net_system</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-fire_tk\"><a href=\"#val-fire_tk\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> fire_tk : \u000A  <span><a href=\"#type-net_system\">net_system</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../Token/index.html#type-markingTok\">Token.markingTok</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../Net/index.html#type-transition\">Net.transition</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"#type-net_system\">net_system</a> option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>fire_tk ns m tid</code> fires <code>tid</code> consuming the tokens <code>m ⊆ ns.m</code>.</p><p>With <code>w_s</code> the token of <code>m</code> in <code>s ∈ •t</code> and <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">w = (\\lambda(t), \\langle\\!\\langle w_{s_1},\\dots,w_{s_n}\\rangle\\!\\rangle, i)</code>:</p><div><pre class=\"odoc-katex-math display\">m'(s) = \\begin{cases}\u000A      m(s) - w_s + w &amp; s \\in {}^\\bullet t \\cap t^\\bullet \\\\\u000A      m(s) - w_s     &amp; s \\in {}^\\bullet t \\setminus t^\\bullet \\\\\u000A      m(s) + w       &amp; s \\in t^\\bullet \\setminus {}^\\bullet t \\\\\u000A      m(s)           &amp; \\text{otherwise}\u000A    \\end{cases}</pre></div><p>Returns <code>None</code> if <code>m</code> is not a valid choice of tokens for <code>t</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-firing_sequence_tk\"><a href=\"#val-firing_sequence_tk\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> firing_sequence_tk : \u000A  <span><a href=\"#type-net_system\">net_system</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><a href=\"../Token/index.html#type-markingTok\">Token.markingTok</a> list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><a href=\"../Net/index.html#type-transition\">Net.transition</a> list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"#type-net_system\">net_system</a> option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>firing_sequence_tk tn ts</code> fires all transitions in <code>ts</code> in order. Returns <code>Some tn'</code> if every step succeeds, <code>None</code> at first failure.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-is_initial\"><a href=\"#val-is_initial\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> is_initial : <span><a href=\"#type-net_system\">net_system</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Token/index.html#type-markingTok\">Token.markingTok</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-keyPairNet\"><a href=\"#type-keyPairNet\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> keyPairNet</span><span> = </span><span>{</span></code><ol><li id=\"type-keyPairNet.net\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-keyPairNet.net\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>net : <a href=\"../Net/index.html#type-labelled_net\">Net.labelled_net</a>;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-keyPairNet.key\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-keyPairNet.key\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>key : <span><a href=\"../Net/index.html#type-place\">Net.place</a> list</span>;</span></code></li></ol><code><span>}</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-is_key_net\"><a href=\"#val-is_key_net\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> is_key_net : <span><a href=\"#type-keyPairNet\">keyPairNet</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><b>Key Labelled Net.</b> A net <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">K = (N, S_k)</code> is called <b>key labelled net</b> (or key net) if for every <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">t \\in T</code>, <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">|t^{\\bullet} \\cap S_k| = 1</code>, and for all <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">s \\in S_k</code>, such that <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">|s^{\\bullet}|=0 \\wedge |{}^{\\bullet} s|=1.</code></p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-keypl\"><a href=\"#val-keypl\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> keypl : <span><a href=\"#type-keyPairNet\">keyPairNet</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Net/index.html#type-transition\">Net.transition</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Net/index.html#type-place\">Net.place</a> list</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Let <code>kn = (N, S_k)</code> be a key labelled net and let <code>t</code> be a transition. Then with <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">s^t</code> we denote the <b>key place</b> <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">s^t \\in S_k</code> such that <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">{}^{\\bullet} s^t = \\{t\\}</code>. The key place associated to a transition <code>t</code> is denoted with <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">\\mathsf{keypl}(t)</code>. So, <code>keypl kn t</code> returns the key place associated to <code>t</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-is_key_initial\"><a href=\"#val-is_key_initial\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> is_key_initial : <span><a href=\"#type-keyPairNet\">keyPairNet</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Token/index.html#type-markingTok\">Token.markingTok</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>We say that <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">m</code> is <b>key initial</b> in a key net iff (a) <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">\\forall s \\in S, [\\![ m(s) ]\\!] \\subseteq \\{(\\cdot,\\langle\\!\\langle \\rangle\\!\\rangle, \\cdot)\\}</code> and (b) <code class=\"odoc-katex-math\">\\forall s \\in S_k, m(s) = 0</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-ReversingNet\"><a href=\"#module-ReversingNet\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"ReversingNet/index.html\">ReversingNet</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div></div>"}